        Hostname is the value to be used to replace the Host header value during
        forwarding.

        Support: Extended
    path : GatewayNetworkingK8sIoV1HTTPRouteSpecRulesItems0FiltersItems0URLRewritePath, default is Undefined, optional
        path
    """


    hostname?: str

